        "Worker pools scale per Temporal task queue via KEDA",
        "Agents query ClickHouse metrics through the dbt semantic layer",
        "IN-1 and US-dedicated run the identical stack"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Inference economics",
      "items": [
        "nova-extract points at a regional vLLM pool",
        "OpenRouter stays as fallback and burst capacity",
        "Target < $0.01 per document blended"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "Isolation",
      "items": [
        "Cells bound blast radius and meet EU / India / US residency",
        "Largest tenants (> 20% of a cell) get a dedicated cell",
